{"id":"0f2bb87045d6238a","group":"93","path":"93/93-df-monoidal-category.md","title":"Monoidal Category","display":"df-monoidal-category — Monoidal Category","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-df-monoidal-category","aliases":["93-df-monoidal-category"],"display":"df-monoidal-category — Monoidal Category","depends_on":["[[93-df-category]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-df-monoidal-category"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-df-monoidal-category</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-monoidal-category — Monoidal Category"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"aa74a8aadef06b6c\" href=\"?note=aa74a8aadef06b6c\" title=\"93-df-category\">93-df-category</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C\">\\(\\mathcal C\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"aa74a8aadef06b6c\" href=\"?note=aa74a8aadef06b6c\" title=\"93-df-category\">93-df-category</a> 的小范畴四元组编码；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ob}\">\\(\\operatorname{Ob}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Hom}\">\\(\\operatorname{Hom}\\)</span> 是下列正式别名。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\otimes\">\\(\\otimes\\)</span> 由对象映射和态射映射两部分组成。</li>\n<li>原调用接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Monoidal}_{71}(\\mathcal C,\\otimes,I,\\alpha,\\lambda,\\rho)\">\\(\\operatorname{Monoidal}_{71}(\\mathcal C,\\otimes,I,\\alpha,\\lambda,\\rho)\\)</span> 保留不变；下标 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"71\">\\(71\\)</span> 是谓词名的一部分，不再表示外部文件依赖。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Mor}_{93}\">\\(\\operatorname{Mor}_{93}\\)</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cat}_{93}(\\mathcal C)\">\\(\\mathrm{Cat}_{93}(\\mathcal C)\\)</span> 上定义；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TObj}_{93}\">\\(\\operatorname{TObj}_{93}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TArr}_{93}\">\\(\\operatorname{TArr}_{93}\\)</span> 分别在张量对象对、张量态射对上取值，不因对象集合与态射集合偶然相交而混用。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CIso}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{CIso}_{93}\\)</span> 是带源、靶的范畴同构谓词；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{CInv}_{93}\">\\(\\operatorname{CInv}_{93}\\)</span> 仅在该谓词成立时定义。约束分量及其逆仅在对应 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Monoidal}_{71}\">\\(\\operatorname{Monoidal}_{71}\\)</span> 成立、且所有对象属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\">\\(\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\)</span> 时使用。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Obj}_{\\mathcal C},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(A,B)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(A,B),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Mor}_{93}(\\mathcal C)\\coloneqq\n\\bigcup_{A,B\\in\\mathrm{Obj}_{\\mathcal C}}\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(A,B)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Obj}_{\\mathcal C},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(A,B)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(A,B),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Mor}_{93}(\\mathcal C)\\coloneqq\n\\bigcup_{A,B\\in\\mathrm{Obj}_{\\mathcal C}}\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(A,B)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TObj}_{93}(A,B;\\langle t_0,t_1\\rangle)\\coloneqq t_0(\\langle A,B\\rangle),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{TArr}_{93}(f,g;\\langle t_0,t_1\\rangle)\\coloneqq t_1(\\langle f,g\\rangle)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{TObj}_{93}(A,B;\\langle t_0,t_1\\rangle)\\coloneqq t_0(\\langle A,B\\rangle),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{TArr}_{93}(f,g;\\langle t_0,t_1\\rangle)\\coloneqq t_1(\\langle f,g\\rangle)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{CIso}_{93}(f,A,B;\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Cat}_{93}(\\mathcal C)\\land A,B\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\n\\land f\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(A,B)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists g\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(B,A)\\;\n(g\\circ_{\\mathcal C}f=\\mathrm{id}^{\\mathcal C}_A\n\\land f\\circ_{\\mathcal C}g=\\mathrm{id}^{\\mathcal C}_B).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{CIso}_{93}(f,A,B;\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Cat}_{93}(\\mathcal C)\\land A,B\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\n\\land f\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(A,B)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists g\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(B,A)\\;\n(g\\circ_{\\mathcal C}f=\\mathrm{id}^{\\mathcal C}_A\n\\land f\\circ_{\\mathcal C}g=\\mathrm{id}^{\\mathcal C}_B).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{CInv}_{93}(f,A,B;\\mathcal C)\\coloneqq\n\\iota g\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(B,A)\\;\n(g\\circ_{\\mathcal C}f=\\mathrm{id}^{\\mathcal C}_A\n\\land f\\circ_{\\mathcal C}g=\\mathrm{id}^{\\mathcal C}_B)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{CInv}_{93}(f,A,B;\\mathcal C)\\coloneqq\n\\iota g\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(B,A)\\;\n(g\\circ_{\\mathcal C}f=\\mathrm{id}^{\\mathcal C}_A\n\\land f\\circ_{\\mathcal C}g=\\mathrm{id}^{\\mathcal C}_B)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{CIso}_{93}(f,A,B;\\mathcal C)\\to\n\\exists!g\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(B,A)\\;\n(g\\circ_{\\mathcal C}f=\\mathrm{id}^{\\mathcal C}_A\n\\land f\\circ_{\\mathcal C}g=\\mathrm{id}^{\\mathcal C}_B).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{CIso}_{93}(f,A,B;\\mathcal C)\\to\n\\exists!g\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(B,A)\\;\n(g\\circ_{\\mathcal C}f=\\mathrm{id}^{\\mathcal C}_A\n\\land f\\circ_{\\mathcal C}g=\\mathrm{id}^{\\mathcal C}_B).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Tensor}_{93}(\\mathcal C,\\otimes)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Cat}_{93}(\\mathcal C)\\land\\exists t_0,t_1\\;[\n\\otimes=\\langle t_0,t_1\\rangle\n\\land t_0:\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)^2\\to\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\\\\n&amp;\\land t_1:\\operatorname{Mor}_{93}(\\mathcal C)^2\\to\\operatorname{Mor}_{93}(\\mathcal C)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall A,B,A&#39;,B&#39;\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\;\n\\forall f\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(A,A&#39;)\\;\n\\forall g\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(B,B&#39;)\\;\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{4em}t_1(\\langle f,g\\rangle)\\in\n\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(t_0(\\langle A,B\\rangle),t_0(\\langle A&#39;,B&#39;\\rangle))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall A,B\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\;\nt_1(\\langle\\mathrm{id}^{\\mathcal C}_A,\\mathrm{id}^{\\mathcal C}_B\\rangle)\n=\\mathrm{id}^{\\mathcal C}_{t_0(\\langle A,B\\rangle)}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall A_0,A_1,A_2,B_0,B_1,B_2\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\;\n\\forall f\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(A_0,A_1)\\;\n\\forall f&#39;\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(A_1,A_2)\\;\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{2em}\\forall g\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(B_0,B_1)\\;\n\\forall g&#39;\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(B_1,B_2)\\;\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{4em}t_1(\\langle f&#39;\\circ_{\\mathcal C}f,g&#39;\\circ_{\\mathcal C}g\\rangle)\n=t_1(\\langle f&#39;,g&#39;\\rangle)\\circ_{\\mathcal C}t_1(\\langle f,g\\rangle)].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Tensor}_{93}(\\mathcal C,\\otimes)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Cat}_{93}(\\mathcal C)\\land\\exists t_0,t_1\\;[\n\\otimes=\\langle t_0,t_1\\rangle\n\\land t_0:\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)^2\\to\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\\\\n&amp;\\land t_1:\\operatorname{Mor}_{93}(\\mathcal C)^2\\to\\operatorname{Mor}_{93}(\\mathcal C)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall A,B,A&#39;,B&#39;\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\;\n\\forall f\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(A,A&#39;)\\;\n\\forall g\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(B,B&#39;)\\;\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{4em}t_1(\\langle f,g\\rangle)\\in\n\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(t_0(\\langle A,B\\rangle),t_0(\\langle A&#39;,B&#39;\\rangle))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall A,B\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\;\nt_1(\\langle\\mathrm{id}^{\\mathcal C}_A,\\mathrm{id}^{\\mathcal C}_B\\rangle)\n=\\mathrm{id}^{\\mathcal C}_{t_0(\\langle A,B\\rangle)}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall A_0,A_1,A_2,B_0,B_1,B_2\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\;\n\\forall f\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(A_0,A_1)\\;\n\\forall f&#39;\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(A_1,A_2)\\;\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{2em}\\forall g\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(B_0,B_1)\\;\n\\forall g&#39;\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(B_1,B_2)\\;\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{4em}t_1(\\langle f&#39;\\circ_{\\mathcal C}f,g&#39;\\circ_{\\mathcal C}g\\rangle)\n=t_1(\\langle f&#39;,g&#39;\\rangle)\\circ_{\\mathcal C}t_1(\\langle f,g\\rangle)].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Monoidal}_{71}(\\mathcal C,\\otimes,I,\\alpha,\\lambda,\\rho)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Tensor}_{93}(\\mathcal C,\\otimes)\\land I\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\alpha:\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)^3\\to\\operatorname{Mor}_{93}(\\mathcal C)\n\\land\\lambda,\\rho:\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\to\\operatorname{Mor}_{93}(\\mathcal C)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall A,B,C\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\;\n\\mathrm{CIso}_{93}\\!\\left(\\alpha(\\langle A,B,C\\rangle),\n\\operatorname{TObj}_{93}(\\operatorname{TObj}_{93}(A,B;\\otimes),C;\\otimes),\n\\operatorname{TObj}_{93}(A,\\operatorname{TObj}_{93}(B,C;\\otimes);\\otimes);\\mathcal C\\right)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall A\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\;\\Bigl[\n\\mathrm{CIso}_{93}(\\lambda(A),\\operatorname{TObj}_{93}(I,A;\\otimes),A;\\mathcal C)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{13em}\\land\n\\mathrm{CIso}_{93}(\\rho(A),\\operatorname{TObj}_{93}(A,I;\\otimes),A;\\mathcal C)\\Bigr]\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall A,B,C,A&#39;,B&#39;,C&#39;\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\;\n\\forall f\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(A,A&#39;)\\;\n\\forall g\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(B,B&#39;)\\;\n\\forall h\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(C,C&#39;)\\;\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{2em}\\alpha(\\langle A&#39;,B&#39;,C&#39;\\rangle)\\circ_{\\mathcal C}\n\\operatorname{TArr}_{93}(\\operatorname{TArr}_{93}(f,g;\\otimes),h;\\otimes)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{4em}=\n\\operatorname{TArr}_{93}(f,\\operatorname{TArr}_{93}(g,h;\\otimes);\\otimes)\n\\circ_{\\mathcal C}\\alpha(\\langle A,B,C\\rangle)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall A,B\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\;\n\\forall f\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(A,B)\\;\\Bigl[\n\\lambda(B)\\circ_{\\mathcal C}\\operatorname{TArr}_{93}(\\mathrm{id}^{\\mathcal C}_I,f;\\otimes)\n=f\\circ_{\\mathcal C}\\lambda(A)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{13em}\\land\n\\rho(B)\\circ_{\\mathcal C}\\operatorname{TArr}_{93}(f,\\mathrm{id}^{\\mathcal C}_I;\\otimes)\n=f\\circ_{\\mathcal C}\\rho(A)\\Bigr]\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall A,B,C,D\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\;\\Bigl[\n\\alpha(\\langle A,B,\\operatorname{TObj}_{93}(C,D;\\otimes)\\rangle)\n\\circ_{\\mathcal C}\\alpha(\\langle\\operatorname{TObj}_{93}(A,B;\\otimes),C,D\\rangle)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{3em}=\n\\Bigl(\\operatorname{TArr}_{93}(\\mathrm{id}^{\\mathcal C}_A,\\alpha(\\langle B,C,D\\rangle);\\otimes)\n\\circ_{\\mathcal C}\\alpha(\\langle A,\\operatorname{TObj}_{93}(B,C;\\otimes),D\\rangle)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{7em}\\circ_{\\mathcal C}\n\\operatorname{TArr}_{93}(\\alpha(\\langle A,B,C\\rangle),\\mathrm{id}^{\\mathcal C}_D;\\otimes)\\Bigr]\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall A,B\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\;\\Bigl[\n\\operatorname{TArr}_{93}(\\mathrm{id}^{\\mathcal C}_A,\\lambda(B);\\otimes)\n\\circ_{\\mathcal C}\\alpha(\\langle A,I,B\\rangle)\n=\\operatorname{TArr}_{93}(\\rho(A),\\mathrm{id}^{\\mathcal C}_B;\\otimes)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Monoidal}_{71}(\\mathcal C,\\otimes,I,\\alpha,\\lambda,\\rho)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Tensor}_{93}(\\mathcal C,\\otimes)\\land I\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\alpha:\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)^3\\to\\operatorname{Mor}_{93}(\\mathcal C)\n\\land\\lambda,\\rho:\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\to\\operatorname{Mor}_{93}(\\mathcal C)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall A,B,C\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\;\n\\mathrm{CIso}_{93}\\!\\left(\\alpha(\\langle A,B,C\\rangle),\n\\operatorname{TObj}_{93}(\\operatorname{TObj}_{93}(A,B;\\otimes),C;\\otimes),\n\\operatorname{TObj}_{93}(A,\\operatorname{TObj}_{93}(B,C;\\otimes);\\otimes);\\mathcal C\\right)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall A\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\;\\Bigl[\n\\mathrm{CIso}_{93}(\\lambda(A),\\operatorname{TObj}_{93}(I,A;\\otimes),A;\\mathcal C)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{13em}\\land\n\\mathrm{CIso}_{93}(\\rho(A),\\operatorname{TObj}_{93}(A,I;\\otimes),A;\\mathcal C)\\Bigr]\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall A,B,C,A&#39;,B&#39;,C&#39;\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\;\n\\forall f\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(A,A&#39;)\\;\n\\forall g\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(B,B&#39;)\\;\n\\forall h\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(C,C&#39;)\\;\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{2em}\\alpha(\\langle A&#39;,B&#39;,C&#39;\\rangle)\\circ_{\\mathcal C}\n\\operatorname{TArr}_{93}(\\operatorname{TArr}_{93}(f,g;\\otimes),h;\\otimes)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{4em}=\n\\operatorname{TArr}_{93}(f,\\operatorname{TArr}_{93}(g,h;\\otimes);\\otimes)\n\\circ_{\\mathcal C}\\alpha(\\langle A,B,C\\rangle)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall A,B\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\;\n\\forall f\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(A,B)\\;\\Bigl[\n\\lambda(B)\\circ_{\\mathcal C}\\operatorname{TArr}_{93}(\\mathrm{id}^{\\mathcal C}_I,f;\\otimes)\n=f\\circ_{\\mathcal C}\\lambda(A)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{13em}\\land\n\\rho(B)\\circ_{\\mathcal C}\\operatorname{TArr}_{93}(f,\\mathrm{id}^{\\mathcal C}_I;\\otimes)\n=f\\circ_{\\mathcal C}\\rho(A)\\Bigr]\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall A,B,C,D\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\;\\Bigl[\n\\alpha(\\langle A,B,\\operatorname{TObj}_{93}(C,D;\\otimes)\\rangle)\n\\circ_{\\mathcal C}\\alpha(\\langle\\operatorname{TObj}_{93}(A,B;\\otimes),C,D\\rangle)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{3em}=\n\\Bigl(\\operatorname{TArr}_{93}(\\mathrm{id}^{\\mathcal C}_A,\\alpha(\\langle B,C,D\\rangle);\\otimes)\n\\circ_{\\mathcal C}\\alpha(\\langle A,\\operatorname{TObj}_{93}(B,C;\\otimes),D\\rangle)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{7em}\\circ_{\\mathcal C}\n\\operatorname{TArr}_{93}(\\alpha(\\langle A,B,C\\rangle),\\mathrm{id}^{\\mathcal C}_D;\\otimes)\\Bigr]\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall A,B\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\;\\Bigl[\n\\operatorname{TArr}_{93}(\\mathrm{id}^{\\mathcal C}_A,\\lambda(B);\\otimes)\n\\circ_{\\mathcal C}\\alpha(\\langle A,I,B\\rangle)\n=\\operatorname{TArr}_{93}(\\rho(A),\\mathrm{id}^{\\mathcal C}_B;\\otimes)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\alpha_{A,B,C}\\coloneqq\\alpha(\\langle A,B,C\\rangle),\\qquad\n\\lambda_A\\coloneqq\\lambda(A),\\qquad\\rho_A\\coloneqq\\rho(A)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\alpha_{A,B,C}\\coloneqq\\alpha(\\langle A,B,C\\rangle),\\qquad\n\\lambda_A\\coloneqq\\lambda(A),\\qquad\\rho_A\\coloneqq\\rho(A)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\alpha^{-1}_{A,B,C}\\coloneqq\n\\operatorname{CInv}_{93}\\!\\left(\\alpha_{A,B,C},\n\\operatorname{TObj}_{93}(\\operatorname{TObj}_{93}(A,B;\\otimes),C;\\otimes),\n\\operatorname{TObj}_{93}(A,\\operatorname{TObj}_{93}(B,C;\\otimes);\\otimes);\\mathcal C\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\alpha^{-1}_{A,B,C}\\coloneqq\n\\operatorname{CInv}_{93}\\!\\left(\\alpha_{A,B,C},\n\\operatorname{TObj}_{93}(\\operatorname{TObj}_{93}(A,B;\\otimes),C;\\otimes),\n\\operatorname{TObj}_{93}(A,\\operatorname{TObj}_{93}(B,C;\\otimes);\\otimes);\\mathcal C\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\lambda_A^{-1}\\coloneqq\n\\operatorname{CInv}_{93}(\\lambda_A,\\operatorname{TObj}_{93}(I,A;\\otimes),A;\\mathcal C),\\qquad\n\\rho_A^{-1}\\coloneqq\n\\operatorname{CInv}_{93}(\\rho_A,\\operatorname{TObj}_{93}(A,I;\\otimes),A;\\mathcal C)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\lambda_A^{-1}\\coloneqq\n\\operatorname{CInv}_{93}(\\lambda_A,\\operatorname{TObj}_{93}(I,A;\\otimes),A;\\mathcal C),\\qquad\n\\rho_A^{-1}\\coloneqq\n\\operatorname{CInv}_{93}(\\rho_A,\\operatorname{TObj}_{93}(A,I;\\otimes),A;\\mathcal C)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>补齐原 71-df-monoidal-category 的六参数接口。张量的双函子条件、约束的可逆性与自然性、五边形和三角形等式均在 Assertion 中给出；不以“满足通常相容性”代替公理。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-category","status":"resolved","id":"aa74a8aadef06b6c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-category]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-category","status":"resolved","id":"aa74a8aadef06b6c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal C$ 使用 [[93-df-category]] 的小范畴四元组编码；$\\operatorname{Ob}$、$\\operatorname{Hom}$ 是下列正式别名。$\\otimes$ 由对象映射和态射映射两部分组成。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal C","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Ob}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Hom}","display":false},{"tex":"\\otimes","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Monoidal}_{71}(\\mathcal C,\\otimes,I,\\alpha,\\lambda,\\rho)","display":false},{"tex":"71","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Mor}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cat}_{93}(\\mathcal C)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{TObj}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{TArr}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CIso}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{CInv}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Monoidal}_{71}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Obj}_{\\mathcal C},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(A,B)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(A,B),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Mor}_{93}(\\mathcal C)\\coloneqq\n\\bigcup_{A,B\\in\\mathrm{Obj}_{\\mathcal C}}\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(A,B)","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{TObj}_{93}(A,B;\\langle t_0,t_1\\rangle)\\coloneqq t_0(\\langle A,B\\rangle),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{TArr}_{93}(f,g;\\langle t_0,t_1\\rangle)\\coloneqq t_1(\\langle f,g\\rangle)","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{CIso}_{93}(f,A,B;\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{Cat}_{93}(\\mathcal C)\\land A,B\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\n\\land f\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(A,B)\\\\\n&\\land\\exists g\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(B,A)\\;\n(g\\circ_{\\mathcal C}f=\\mathrm{id}^{\\mathcal C}_A\n\\land f\\circ_{\\mathcal C}g=\\mathrm{id}^{\\mathcal C}_B).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{CInv}_{93}(f,A,B;\\mathcal C)\\coloneqq\n\\iota g\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(B,A)\\;\n(g\\circ_{\\mathcal C}f=\\mathrm{id}^{\\mathcal C}_A\n\\land f\\circ_{\\mathcal C}g=\\mathrm{id}^{\\mathcal C}_B)","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{CIso}_{93}(f,A,B;\\mathcal C)\\to\n\\exists!g\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(B,A)\\;\n(g\\circ_{\\mathcal C}f=\\mathrm{id}^{\\mathcal C}_A\n\\land f\\circ_{\\mathcal C}g=\\mathrm{id}^{\\mathcal C}_B).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Tensor}_{93}(\\mathcal C,\\otimes)\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{Cat}_{93}(\\mathcal C)\\land\\exists t_0,t_1\\;[\n\\otimes=\\langle t_0,t_1\\rangle\n\\land t_0:\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)^2\\to\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\\\\n&\\land t_1:\\operatorname{Mor}_{93}(\\mathcal C)^2\\to\\operatorname{Mor}_{93}(\\mathcal C)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall A,B,A',B'\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\;\n\\forall f\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(A,A')\\;\n\\forall g\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(B,B')\\;\\\\\n&\\hspace{4em}t_1(\\langle f,g\\rangle)\\in\n\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(t_0(\\langle A,B\\rangle),t_0(\\langle A',B'\\rangle))\\\\\n&\\land\\forall A,B\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\;\nt_1(\\langle\\mathrm{id}^{\\mathcal C}_A,\\mathrm{id}^{\\mathcal C}_B\\rangle)\n=\\mathrm{id}^{\\mathcal C}_{t_0(\\langle A,B\\rangle)}\\\\\n&\\land\\forall A_0,A_1,A_2,B_0,B_1,B_2\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\;\n\\forall f\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(A_0,A_1)\\;\n\\forall f'\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(A_1,A_2)\\;\\\\\n&\\hspace{2em}\\forall g\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(B_0,B_1)\\;\n\\forall g'\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(B_1,B_2)\\;\\\\\n&\\hspace{4em}t_1(\\langle f'\\circ_{\\mathcal C}f,g'\\circ_{\\mathcal C}g\\rangle)\n=t_1(\\langle f',g'\\rangle)\\circ_{\\mathcal C}t_1(\\langle f,g\\rangle)].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Monoidal}_{71}(\\mathcal C,\\otimes,I,\\alpha,\\lambda,\\rho)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{Tensor}_{93}(\\mathcal C,\\otimes)\\land I\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\\\\n&\\land\\alpha:\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)^3\\to\\operatorname{Mor}_{93}(\\mathcal C)\n\\land\\lambda,\\rho:\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\to\\operatorname{Mor}_{93}(\\mathcal C)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall A,B,C\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\;\n\\mathrm{CIso}_{93}\\!\\left(\\alpha(\\langle A,B,C\\rangle),\n\\operatorname{TObj}_{93}(\\operatorname{TObj}_{93}(A,B;\\otimes),C;\\otimes),\n\\operatorname{TObj}_{93}(A,\\operatorname{TObj}_{93}(B,C;\\otimes);\\otimes);\\mathcal C\\right)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall A\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\;\\Bigl[\n\\mathrm{CIso}_{93}(\\lambda(A),\\operatorname{TObj}_{93}(I,A;\\otimes),A;\\mathcal C)\\\\\n&\\hspace{13em}\\land\n\\mathrm{CIso}_{93}(\\rho(A),\\operatorname{TObj}_{93}(A,I;\\otimes),A;\\mathcal C)\\Bigr]\\\\\n&\\land\\forall A,B,C,A',B',C'\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\;\n\\forall f\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(A,A')\\;\n\\forall g\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(B,B')\\;\n\\forall h\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(C,C')\\;\\\\\n&\\hspace{2em}\\alpha(\\langle A',B',C'\\rangle)\\circ_{\\mathcal C}\n\\operatorname{TArr}_{93}(\\operatorname{TArr}_{93}(f,g;\\otimes),h;\\otimes)\\\\\n&\\hspace{4em}=\n\\operatorname{TArr}_{93}(f,\\operatorname{TArr}_{93}(g,h;\\otimes);\\otimes)\n\\circ_{\\mathcal C}\\alpha(\\langle A,B,C\\rangle)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall A,B\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\;\n\\forall f\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(A,B)\\;\\Bigl[\n\\lambda(B)\\circ_{\\mathcal C}\\operatorname{TArr}_{93}(\\mathrm{id}^{\\mathcal C}_I,f;\\otimes)\n=f\\circ_{\\mathcal C}\\lambda(A)\\\\\n&\\hspace{13em}\\land\n\\rho(B)\\circ_{\\mathcal C}\\operatorname{TArr}_{93}(f,\\mathrm{id}^{\\mathcal C}_I;\\otimes)\n=f\\circ_{\\mathcal C}\\rho(A)\\Bigr]\\\\\n&\\land\\forall A,B,C,D\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\;\\Bigl[\n\\alpha(\\langle A,B,\\operatorname{TObj}_{93}(C,D;\\otimes)\\rangle)\n\\circ_{\\mathcal C}\\alpha(\\langle\\operatorname{TObj}_{93}(A,B;\\otimes),C,D\\rangle)\\\\\n&\\hspace{3em}=\n\\Bigl(\\operatorname{TArr}_{93}(\\mathrm{id}^{\\mathcal C}_A,\\alpha(\\langle B,C,D\\rangle);\\otimes)\n\\circ_{\\mathcal C}\\alpha(\\langle A,\\operatorname{TObj}_{93}(B,C;\\otimes),D\\rangle)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&\\hspace{7em}\\circ_{\\mathcal C}\n\\operatorname{TArr}_{93}(\\alpha(\\langle A,B,C\\rangle),\\mathrm{id}^{\\mathcal C}_D;\\otimes)\\Bigr]\\\\\n&\\land\\forall A,B\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\;\\Bigl[\n\\operatorname{TArr}_{93}(\\mathrm{id}^{\\mathcal C}_A,\\lambda(B);\\otimes)\n\\circ_{\\mathcal C}\\alpha(\\langle A,I,B\\rangle)\n=\\operatorname{TArr}_{93}(\\rho(A),\\mathrm{id}^{\\mathcal C}_B;\\otimes)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\alpha_{A,B,C}\\coloneqq\\alpha(\\langle A,B,C\\rangle),\\qquad\n\\lambda_A\\coloneqq\\lambda(A),\\qquad\\rho_A\\coloneqq\\rho(A)","display":true},{"tex":"\\alpha^{-1}_{A,B,C}\\coloneqq\n\\operatorname{CInv}_{93}\\!\\left(\\alpha_{A,B,C},\n\\operatorname{TObj}_{93}(\\operatorname{TObj}_{93}(A,B;\\otimes),C;\\otimes),\n\\operatorname{TObj}_{93}(A,\\operatorname{TObj}_{93}(B,C;\\otimes);\\otimes);\\mathcal C\\right)","display":true},{"tex":"\\lambda_A^{-1}\\coloneqq\n\\operatorname{CInv}_{93}(\\lambda_A,\\operatorname{TObj}_{93}(I,A;\\otimes),A;\\mathcal C),\\qquad\n\\rho_A^{-1}\\coloneqq\n\\operatorname{CInv}_{93}(\\rho_A,\\operatorname{TObj}_{93}(A,I;\\otimes),A;\\mathcal C)","display":true}],"bytes":7148,"backlinks":[{"id":"97a6f341b7a6e48c","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$\\mathfrak M$ is a six-component monoidal-category candidate; $\\operatorname{Monoidal}_{71}$, $\\operatorname{Ob}$, and $\\operatorname{Hom}$ are the sourced monoidal-category predicate, object projection, and hom-family notation of [[93-df-monoidal-category]]."},{"id":"07f5930ce42abb03","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Monoidal}_{71}$ is the exact monoidal-category predicate of [[93-df-monoidal-category]]."}],"outgoing":["aa74a8aadef06b6c"]}